            "notes": "### Core Changes\n\n*Most Important Stat: [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)*\n\n1. Sell everything.\n2. Buy [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56)\n3. Buy as many as possible (in order of usefulness):\n    - [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)\n    - [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2)\n    - [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e)\n    - [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)\n    - [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295)\n    - [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36)\n\n(Note: Nano Cola alone costs 6k, but with 5.75k you can buy Custom Stock, Power Playbook and Charged Plating, granting you 30% [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) as opposed to Nano Cola's 20%.",
