            "notes": "### Core Changes\n\n*Stat Priority: Self Heal -> [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) -> [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) -> [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power)*\n\n1. Take [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8)\n    - [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8) is everything to this build, apply packs to gain a ludicrous amount of self healing.\n2. Sell everything\n3. Buy [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7)\n    - [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) enables you to exist on the frontline and derive value from swinging on people. Do not substitute this for any other item.\n4. Buy one of:\n    - [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8)\n       - [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) is a great help for healing yourself when you are unable to pack or swing on someone. This is the best item to take if you think you **need** a ton of extra survivability.\n    - [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) \n       - This item will further increase the sustain you get from your melee whilst increasing your damage. Consider taking if you think living isn't that much of a struggle.\n5. Buy [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318)\n    - Lifesteal is good.\n\n### Missing/Spare Cash\n\nIf you are unable to afford [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8), or have extra cash to spare you first buy as much [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) and [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) items as possible.\n\nMore attack speed allows us to benefit from [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) and [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal). So taking as much of both as possible helps with our survivability.\n\n### Playstyle Changes\n\n**This round changes your playstyle dramatically.**\n\n- You will now want to play aggressively from now on, position yourself relative to where your tank is. When they engage, you engage. When they backup, you backup. Match their tempo. Try to stay alive. The longer you live the more money you can make.\n\n- REMEMBER TO USE [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8)!!! This build crumbles when this is not taken advantage of. Make sure you apply repair packs to your allies (primarily your tank) **before** engaging. The more people you have packs active on the more healing you will benefit from, upwards to 15% max life per second. Please, make sure to take advantage of this.\n\n- Whipshot often! [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422) synergizes with [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8) naturally, the longer your repair packs last the longer you can heal off of them. Be mindful not to boop away the target you are trying to swing on, or you will not be able to heal yourself via [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7). Either whipshot a target nearby or use it to finish off your target.",
