            "notes": "### Core Changes\n\n*Stat Priority: Self Heal -> [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) -> [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) -> [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power)*\n\n1. Buy one of:\n    - [Nullifier Neuroworks](item_6501be99-b951-4dad-9bb5-8305eb17d84e)\n       - This item allows you to apply repair packs brainlessly, you do not need to think at all with this item. I believe this to be the best item available here. Consider this if you want to maximize [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8) value.\n    - [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448)\n       - Brig can easily get maximum value out of [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) due to her abundance of short cooldowns. Consider this if you need the extra damage to win more fights.\n    - [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27)\n       - For matchups into tanks like [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6) and [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85) you will barely damage them without this item, consider if playing into them is going too favourably.\n    - [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643)\n\n### Missing/Spare Cash\n\nSame as before, [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) and [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) items.",
