            "notes": "### Core Changes\n\n*Stat Priority: Self Heal -> [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) -> [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) -> [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power)*\n\n1. Take [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee)\n    - Insane power, allows us to get rally faster and proc tons of inspire in ult.\n2. Buy one of:\n    - [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4)\n       - Synergizes incredibly with [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) and just this build in general, you will get rally incredibly fast from now on. \n    - [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b)\n       - Easily the best weapon power item we can take, this is a great choice if you really just need to deal more damage.\n    - [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643)\n    - [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448)\n    - [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27)\n\n### Missing/Spare Cash\n\nConsider [Junker Whatchamajig](item_b81ebab8-5c85-405a-b28d-2496de33cd9c), [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) already gives you a 25% ult charge lead, with this item that becomes a 50% lead. Make sure to use your ult often with this item so you can maintain your ult advantage all round!\n\nSame as before, [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) and [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) items.\n\n### Playstyle Changes\n\nWith the addition of [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) and [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) you've just ranked up an additional tier of immortality. Remember to land your whipshots and shield bashes to get rally incredibly fast, it will carry fights.",
