            "notes": "### Core Changes\n\n*Stat Priority: Self Heal -> [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) -> [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) -> [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power)*\n\n1. Buy one of:\n    - [Dragons' Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634)\n       - This stacked on top of the rest of the build is disgusting. Makes rally even more fight-winning and makes you un-killable. Ridiculously overpowered.\n    - [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48)\n       - Most valuable [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) item in the game, this will allow us to maximize our [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) value, consider taking if you want to empower yourself globally, instead of just rally.  \n    - [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643)\n    - [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448)\n    - [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27)\n    - [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b)\n2. If you have taken [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) buy one of:\n    - [Junker Whatchamajig](item_b81ebab8-5c85-405a-b28d-2496de33cd9c)\n    - [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054)\n    - [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)\n3. If [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) buy one of: \n     - [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8)\n     - [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318)",
