            "notes": "### Core Changes\n\n*Stat Priority: Self Heal -> [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) -> [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) -> [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power)*\n\n1. Take one of\n    - [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0)\n       - At this point in the game we have around 600~HP, this power allows us to generate extra sustain for our teammates, and even more in rally due to [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee). Take this if you want to further snowball fights.\n    - [Burst Aid](item_a676ca4f-264e-46b1-8a4a-9aa732b95eae)\n       - This power should only be taken if you are **the** carry of the team. Use this as a get out of jail free card when needed, as the health regenerated is a disgusting amount.\n     - [Righteous Cleave](item_fa98450c-b553-431d-997a-60fe2b0abb51)\n       - Provides burst healing on your melee, consider taking if you need the extra healing in the final round.\n     - [Whirlwhip](item_35a738cd-73d3-4d6c-86e4-76df3eeb7df6)\n       - AOE Damage that procs [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) on hit. Untested but could be good for super brawly team fights.\n     - [Lindholm Wall](item_a733a6f5-72cd-43cd-a0fd-b1e03fa34753)\n       - Lowest impact power option here, the additional shield health could be good for surviving poke and escaping, though I would recommend the other powers above.\n2. Buy one of:\n    - [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48)\n    - [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27)\n    - [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643)\n    - [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448)\n    - [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b)\n\n### Playstyle Changes\n\nWelcome to the final round!\n\nThis is going to be a drawn out round, primarily by you as this build is all about being disgustingly high sustain.\n\nFeel free to swap around your items to your liking! The optional items should offer you a variety of choice between a rally focus, sustain focus, and DPS focus for however you want to play. Don't blindly follow this build, inform your item choices based on how the game is going!\n\nFocus on building your rally as soon as possible to win fights, it easily is the highest impact you can offer on [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a), especially if you invest in [Dragons' Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634).\n\nAside from that, play as you have been and good luck on winning!",
